      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9, background: 'rgba(245,241,230,0.72)', padding: 20, marginTop: 16 }}>书架边要贴一张读法指引卡，让下一届学生拿起书就知道怎么读。</Text>
